# DrumMania V (drmnvj) with e-AMUSEMENT on (after drmnvj-eamuse-on): a new card's first credit. Two
# coins, a blank card (the card unit, runtime/python/gfdmcard.h), Start: numbering assign, cardutil
# check (not registered: a gdid given), the name AAA (Start three times, END), the password 1234 twice
# on the 10-key, cardutil regist; the card written; information and gametop get. Then STANDARD and two
# songs (the pads in turn), gameend regist (each stage's score kept on the server), the sale,
# userid ctou, roulette regist, and the card given back.
game drmnvj
at 11000 press "Coin 1" 8
at 11040 press "Coin 1" 8
at 11200 press "Card" 8
at 11400 press "1 Player Start" 8
at 11900 press "1 Player Start" 8
at 11960 press "1 Player Start" 8
at 12020 press "1 Player Start" 8
at 12080 press "Select L" 8
at 12200 press "1 Player Start" 8
at 12500 press "Keypad 1" 8
at 12530 press "Keypad 2" 8
at 12560 press "Keypad 3" 8
at 12590 press "Keypad 4" 8
at 12800 press "Keypad 1" 8
at 12830 press "Keypad 2" 8
at 12860 press "Keypad 3" 8
at 12890 press "Keypad 4" 8
